# 查看指定标签
bash /root/clawd/scripts/md-to-slack.sh /root/clawd/memory/2026-02-10.md tag 任务清单
```

---

### 工具 2: summary-to-slack.sh

**位置**: `/root/clawd/scripts/summary-to-slack.sh`

**功能**:
